  "summary": "Hey there, I'm a creative, detail-oriented software engineer with a deep interest in AI with a proven track record of creating and implementing successful front and back-end web applications. Skilled in solving problems with JavaScript, React, SQL, Node, MongoDB, HTML, CSS, and Express. In fact, solving problems and providing solutions has always been a passion of mine. While working in the Heating and Air Conditioning industry, I was always looking for problems I could solve, ways to improve our business, and how to better serve our clients. When I started working on a web application to help with project management between our multiple teams, I realized just how much I love building and enhancing software to make people's days better. I’ve  been freelancing and helping local businesses with my code ever since. When I'm not coding, I can be found spending time with family, reading all the books, and dabbling in art.",
